# playwright-rs-usage is installed, not vendored (see CLAUDE.md); a tracked
# copy drifts and gets republished to this repo's own skill consumers.
#
# The skills CLI moved the real file to .agents/skills/ and made
# .claude/skills/<name> a symlink to it, so the .claude path alone stopped
# covering anything. Both are listed: the second line is the symlink, the
# first is what it points at.
/.agents/skills/
/.claude/skills/

# Claude Code runtime state (settings.local.json is ignored globally)
/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
/.claude/worktrees/
/.claude/.cc-writes/
